  factories, which mirror ASP.NET's Results.* helpers:

    ✅🐇📬 text❗️     200 text/plain      Results.Ok / Text
    🌸🐇📬 json❗️     200 application/json Results.Json
    🐣🐇📬 json❗️     201 Created          Results.Created
    🕳🐇📬❗️          204 No Content       Results.NoContent
    🚫🐇📬 message❗️  400 Bad Request      Results.BadRequest
    👻🐇📬 message❗️ 404 Not Found        Results.NotFound
    💥🐇📬 message❗️  500 Server Error     Results.Problem
